<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Lord, I have no confidence</l><l>In who I am or what I do.</l><l>Only You are able to</l><l>Endure and overcome;</l><l>Sustain with just one word.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>How we need Your life each day</l><l>To wash our oldness all away.</l><l>Renew me to be Spirit-filled;</l><l>By your abundant grace</l><l>We will run this race.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Shining in the darkest hour,</l><l>Comfort us in every trial;</l><l>Hold us in Your very hand,</l><l>The Body life is real,</l><l>Oh Lord You are so near.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>Saving us from emptiness,</l><l>Broken cisterns holding less,</l><l>Deceitful riches, grasping air,</l><l>Only You are preciousness.</l><l>We will love You with our best.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
